{"seq":1,"slug":"deutsch-jozsa","title":"Deutsch-Jozsa 算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-algorithms/deutsch-jozsa","wordCount":1384,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"deutsch-jozsa-算法\">Deutsch-Jozsa 算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Deutsch-Jozsa 算法（1992）是历史上第一个明确显示量子优势的算法——给定一个 oracle f: {0,1}^N → {0,1} 承诺要么 constant（所有输入相同输出）要么 balanced（一半 0 一半 1），quantum 1 次 oracle query 即可判断（经典最坏 2^(N-1) + 1 次）。这是 quantum 算法的&quot;Hello World&quot;——demonstrate 量子并行 + 干涉的核心思想，是 Shor / Grover 等的概念前驱。虽然 Deutsch-Jozsa 不实用（要求 oracle 严格 promise，现实问题没有这种结构），它的电路仅 H + oracle + H + measurement 就 elegant 展示量子优势。本节给出 Deutsch（单 qubit 简化版）、Deutsch-Jozsa（N qubit 推广）、为什么 work、它教给我们的量子算法 design pattern。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>经典算法</th>\n<th>Deutsch-Jozsa</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Oracle queries</td>\n<td>最坏 2^(N-1) + 1</td>\n<td>仅 1 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>0（exact）</td>\n<td>0（exact）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Promise</td>\n<td>f constant 或 balanced</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实用</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>不实用（演示用途）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概念意义</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>第一个 quantum 加速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"deutsch-s-problem-单-qubit-版\">Deutsch&#39;s Problem（单 qubit 版）</h2><p><strong>Setup</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Oracle 实现 f: {0, 1} → {0, 1}。</li>\n<li>f 承诺要么 constant（f(0) = f(1)）要么 balanced（f(0) ≠ f(1)）。</li>\n<li>有 4 种可能 f：<ul>\n<li>f(x) = 0（constant 0）。</li>\n<li>f(x) = 1（constant 1）。</li>\n<li>f(x) = x（identity, balanced）。</li>\n<li>f(x) = 1-x（NOT, balanced）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>经典</strong>：必须 query f(0) 与 f(1)，2 次 query。</p>\n<p><strong>Quantum</strong>：1 次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deutsch-s-algorithm\">Deutsch&#39;s Algorithm</h2><p><strong>电路</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"q0: |0⟩ ──H──┐         ┌──H──Measure&#10;              │ Oracle U_f│&#10;q1: |1⟩ ──H──┘         └──\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>q0: |0⟩ ──H──┐         ┌──H──Measure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              │ Oracle U_f│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>q1: |1⟩ ──H──┘         └──</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>步骤</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 初始化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>q0 = |0⟩（input）。</li>\n<li>q1 = |1⟩（aux）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. H on both</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"q0: |+⟩&#10;q1: |-⟩&#10;联合态：|+⟩|-⟩ = (|0⟩+|1⟩)(|0⟩-|1⟩)/2&#10;     = (|00⟩-|01⟩+|10⟩-|11⟩)/2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>q0: |+⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>q1: |-⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>联合态：|+⟩|-⟩ = (|0⟩+|1⟩)(|0⟩-|1⟩)/2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     = (|00⟩-|01⟩+|10⟩-|11⟩)/2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. Oracle U_f</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"U_f|x⟩|y⟩ = |x⟩|y ⊕ f(x)⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>U_f|x⟩|y⟩ = |x⟩|y ⊕ f(x)⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p>应用后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"(|0⟩|0⊕f(0)⟩ - |0⟩|1⊕f(0)⟩ + |1⟩|0⊕f(1)⟩ - |1⟩|1⊕f(1)⟩) / 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(|0⟩|0⊕f(0)⟩ - |0⟩|1⊕f(0)⟩ + |1⟩|0⊕f(1)⟩ - |1⟩|1⊕f(1)⟩) / 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Phase kickback</strong>（关键 trick）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"|0⊕f(x)⟩ - |1⊕f(x)⟩ = (-1)^f(x) (|0⟩ - |1⟩)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>|0⊕f(x)⟩ - |1⊕f(x)⟩ = (-1)^f(x) (|0⟩ - |1⟩)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>So：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"((-1)^f(0)|0⟩ + (-1)^f(1)|1⟩) ⊗ (|0⟩-|1⟩)/√2 / √2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>((-1)^f(0)|0⟩ + (-1)^f(1)|1⟩) ⊗ (|0⟩-|1⟩)/√2 / √2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>q1 与 q0 解纠缠，q0 现在是 ((-1)^f(0)|0⟩ + (-1)^f(1)|1⟩) / √2。</p>\n<p><strong>4. H on q0</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 f(0) = f(1)（constant）：q0 = ±|+⟩ → H → ±|0⟩。</li>\n<li>若 f(0) ≠ f(1)（balanced）：q0 = ±|−⟩ → H → ±|1⟩。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 测 q0</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0 → constant。</li>\n<li>1 → balanced。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>仅 1 次 oracle query</strong>——显示量子优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[ket 0 ket 1] --&gt; B[H ⊗ H]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ket plus ket minus]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Oracle U_f]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Phase kickback]&#10;    E --&gt; F[H on q0]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Measure q0]&#10;    G --&gt; H[0 = constant, 1 = balanced]\">graph LR\n    A[ket 0 ket 1] --&gt; B[H ⊗ H]\n    B --&gt; C[ket plus ket minus]\n    C --&gt; D[Oracle U_f]\n    D --&gt; E[Phase kickback]\n    E --&gt; F[H on q0]\n    F --&gt; G[Measure q0]\n    G --&gt; H[0 = constant, 1 = balanced]</pre><h2 id=\"phase-kickback-详细\">Phase Kickback 详细</h2><p><strong>Phase kickback</strong> 是量子算法核心 trick：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>aux qubit 初始为 |-⟩。</li>\n<li>Oracle 应用让 input qubit 拿到 (-1)^f(x) 的相位。</li>\n<li>aux qubit 不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么 work</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"U_f|x⟩|-⟩ = |x⟩(|0⊕f(x)⟩ - |1⊕f(x)⟩)/√2&#10;         = (-1)^f(x) |x⟩|-⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>U_f|x⟩|-⟩ = |x⟩(|0⊕f(x)⟩ - |1⊕f(x)⟩)/√2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         = (-1)^f(x) |x⟩|-⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p>因为 |0⊕f(x)⟩ - |1⊕f(x)⟩ = (-1)^f(x) (|0⟩-|1⟩)。</p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 f 的输出&quot;编码&quot;到 input 的相位。</li>\n<li>后续干涉可&quot;读出&quot;相位信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"deutsch-jozsa-n-qubit-推广\">Deutsch-Jozsa（N qubit 推广）</h2><p><strong>Setup</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>f: {0,1}^N → {0,1}。</li>\n<li>承诺 constant 或 balanced（半数 input 输出 0，半数输出 1）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>经典</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最坏需 2^(N-1) + 1 次 query 确定。</li>\n<li>例：前 2^(N-1) 次都得 0，第 2^(N-1)+1 次得 0 → constant；得 1 → balanced。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quantum</strong>：1 次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deutsch-jozsa-circuit\">Deutsch-Jozsa Circuit</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"q_0..N-1: |0⟩^N ──H^⊗N──┐         ┌──H^⊗N──Measure&#10;                          │ Oracle  │&#10;aux: |1⟩ ──H──            │         │&#10;                          └─────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>q_0..N-1: |0⟩^N ──H^⊗N──┐         ┌──H^⊗N──Measure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                          │ Oracle  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>aux: |1⟩ ──H──            │         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                          └─────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>步骤</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 初始化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>N input qubit 全 |0⟩。</li>\n<li>aux qubit |1⟩。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. H^⊗(N+1)</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"input：(1/√(2^N)) Σ_x |x⟩&#10;aux：|-⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>input：(1/√(2^N)) Σ_x |x⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>aux：|-⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. Oracle</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"U_f|x⟩|y⟩ = |x⟩|y ⊕ f(x)⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>U_f|x⟩|y⟩ = |x⟩|y ⊕ f(x)⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Phase kickback：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"(1/√(2^N)) Σ_x (-1)^f(x) |x⟩ ⊗ |-⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(1/√(2^N)) Σ_x (-1)^f(x) |x⟩ ⊗ |-⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>4. H^⊗N on input</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"H^⊗N |x⟩ = (1/√(2^N)) Σ_z (-1)^(x·z) |z⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>H^⊗N |x⟩ = (1/√(2^N)) Σ_z (-1)^(x·z) |z⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p>应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"(1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^f(x) Σ_z (-1)^(x·z) |z⟩&#10;       = Σ_z [(1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^(f(x) ⊕ x·z)] |z⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^f(x) Σ_z (-1)^(x·z) |z⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       = Σ_z [(1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^(f(x) ⊕ x·z)] |z⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>5. Measure |0...0⟩</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Amplitude = (1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^f(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Amplitude = (1/2^N) Σ_x (-1)^f(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>f constant：所有 (-1)^f(x) 同号 → |amplitude| = 1。</li>\n<li>f balanced：一半 +1 一半 -1 → 互相抵消 → amplitude = 0。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>结果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>测得 |0...0⟩（all zeros）→ constant。</li>\n<li>测得任何其他 → balanced。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>只用 1 次 oracle query</strong>！</p>\n<h2 id=\"干涉是关键\">干涉是关键</h2><p><strong>Deutsch-Jozsa 的核心</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantum：1 次 oracle 拿到所有 2^N 输入的&quot;相位编码&quot;。</li>\n<li>Final H + measure 用干涉读出 global property（constant vs balanced）。</li>\n<li>经典：必须 query 多次个别值，没法利用 global structure。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why DJ doesn&#39;t 实用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实际问题很少有 strict constant / balanced promise。</li>\n<li>但概念是 Shor / Grover / 各种 oracle 算法的祖先。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战-qiskit\">实战 Qiskit</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from qiskit import QuantumCircuit, QuantumRegister, ClassicalRegister&#10;from qiskit_aer import AerSimulator&#10;&#10;def deutsch_jozsa(oracle, n):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;Run DJ algorithm with n-bit oracle.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    qc = QuantumCircuit(n + 1, n)&#10;&#10;    # Initialize aux to |1&gt;&#10;    qc.x(n)&#10;    qc.h(range(n + 1))&#10;&#10;    # Apply oracle&#10;    qc.append(oracle, range(n + 1))&#10;&#10;    # H on inputs&#10;    qc.h(range(n))&#10;&#10;    # Measure&#10;    qc.measure(range(n), range(n))&#10;    return qc&#10;&#10;# Constant-0 oracle&#10;def constant_zero_oracle(n):&#10;    qc = QuantumCircuit(n + 1)&#10;    return qc.to_gate(label=&#39;Constant-0&#39;)&#10;&#10;# Balanced oracle (e.g., f(x) = x_0 XOR x_1)&#10;def balanced_oracle(n):&#10;    qc = QuantumCircuit(n + 1)&#10;    qc.cx(0, n)  # f(x) depends on x_0&#10;    qc.cx(1, n)  # f(x) XOR x_1&#10;    return qc.to_gate(label=&#39;Balanced&#39;)&#10;&#10;# Run&#10;n = 3&#10;qc = deutsch_jozsa(balanced_oracle(n), n)&#10;backend = AerSimulator()&#10;result = backend.run(qc, shots=1).result()&#10;counts = result.get_counts()&#10;# all-zeros → constant; else → balanced\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qiskit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit, QuantumRegister, ClassicalRegister</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qiskit_aer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AerSimulator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deutsch_jozsa</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(oracle, n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"Run DJ algorithm with n-bit oracle.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Initialize aux to |1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.x(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.h(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Apply oracle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.append(oracle, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # H on inputs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.h(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Measure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.measure(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Constant-0 oracle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> constant_zero_oracle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qc.to_gate(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Constant-0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Balanced oracle (e.g., f(x) = x_0 XOR x_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> balanced_oracle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.cx(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># f(x) depends on x_0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qc.cx(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># f(x) XOR x_1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qc.to_gate(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Balanced'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deutsch_jozsa(balanced_oracle(n), n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">backend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AerSimulator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> backend.run(qc, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shots</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).result()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.get_counts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># all-zeros → constant; else → balanced</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dj-pattern-在量子算法中的复用\">DJ Pattern 在量子算法中的复用</h2><p><strong>Pattern</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Equal superposition over inputs（H^⊗N |0⟩^N）。</li>\n<li>Oracle 用 phase kickback 编码 function value。</li>\n<li>Quantum Fourier Transform（H^⊗N 在 binary case）读取 global pattern。</li>\n<li>Measure → global property。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Bernstein-Vazirani (1992)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Promise：f(x) = a · x mod 2 for unknown a。</li>\n<li>Quantum 1 次 query 找 a。</li>\n<li>经典 N 次。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Simon&#39;s Algorithm (1994)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Promise：f(x) = f(y) iff x ⊕ y = s（unknown）。</li>\n<li>Quantum O(N) 次 query。</li>\n<li>经典 Ω(2^(N/2))（指数）。</li>\n<li>Shor 算法的直接前驱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shor&#39;s Algorithm</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Period finding via QFT（Simon 推广到非二进制）。</li>\n<li>破 RSA。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"量子算法-design-原则\">量子算法 design 原则</h2><p><strong>Deutsch-Jozsa 教给我们</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>量子并行</strong>：H^⊗N 一次生成 2^N input superposition。</li>\n<li><strong>Phase kickback</strong>：oracle 把 function value 编码到 phase。</li>\n<li><strong>干涉 + 测量</strong>：把 phase 信息提取为 measurable global property。</li>\n<li><strong>Promise 限制</strong>：量子优势通常需要 input 有 structure。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>没有 promise 的搜索</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Grover 给 √N 加速（vs 经典 N），不是指数。</li>\n<li>强 promise（如 hidden subgroup）有指数加速（Shor、Simon）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"局限\">局限</h2><p><strong>1. 不实用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真实问题没有 constant/balanced 严格 promise。</li>\n<li>仅教学价值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 1 query 是 ideal</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Noisy hardware 上 single-shot 可能错。</li>\n<li>实战需重复 + majority vote。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不 generalize 到 NP</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DJ 是 promise problem，不是 NP-complete。</li>\n<li>量子计算 BQP 与 NP 关系仍 open。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"历史地位\">历史地位</h2><p><strong>1985 Deutsch&#39;s quantum Turing machine paper</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提出 quantum computation。</li>\n<li>给出 Deutsch&#39;s algorithm（单 qubit）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1992 Deutsch-Jozsa</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推广到 N qubit。</li>\n<li>第一个明确量子优势的算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1992 Bernstein-Vazirani</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同样思路，新 promise（黑 box function）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1994 Simon&#39;s algorithm</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次 superpolynomial 加速。</li>\n<li>直接启发 Shor。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1994 Shor&#39;s algorithm</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>破 RSA / 离散对数。</li>\n<li>量子计算最具威胁的算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>总结</strong>：DJ 是 quantum algorithmic 思想的开端——所有后续重要算法（Shor、Grover、QPE、HHL）都用了类似的&quot;superposition + oracle + interference&quot;pattern。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Deutsch-Jozsa 算法是历史上第一个明确量子优势的算法（1992）——oracle f 承诺 constant 或 balanced 的判断，quantum 1 次 query 经典 2^(N-1)+1 次。Deutsch（单 qubit）电路 H ⊗ H → oracle → H on input → measure，phase kickback 把 (-1)^f(x) 编码到 input phase，最终 H 测到 0 (constant) 或 1 (balanced)。Deutsch-Jozsa（N qubit）相同思路 H^⊗(N+1) → oracle → H^⊗N → measure，测 |0...0⟩ → constant 否则 balanced。Phase kickback 是核心 trick：U_f|x⟩|-⟩ = (-1)^f(x)|x⟩|-⟩。干涉让 oracle 全局结构在 1 query 后可测。Pattern：equal superposition + oracle phase encoding + QFT (H^⊗N) + measure 是 Bernstein-Vazirani / Simon / Shor 共同 DNA。Bernstein-Vazirani 找 hidden a, Simon 找 hidden period（superpolynomial 加速首次），Shor 把 Simon 推广到 RSA factoring。设计原则——量子并行 + phase kickback + 干涉 + promise 限制。局限——不实用 promise、noisy single-shot、不解 NP。历史地位——1985 Deutsch 量子 Turing machine、1992 DJ + BV、1994 Simon + Shor。一个简单的检验：你能解释为什么&quot;DJ 1 次 query 经典 2^(N-1)+1 次&quot;？如果不能，量子并行与干涉的力量还需巩固。Deutsch-Jozsa 是量子算法的&quot;Hello World&quot;——理解它你就理解了所有后续重要算法的概念基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Deutsch-Jozsa 算法","id":"deutsch-jozsa-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Deutsch's Problem（单 qubit 版）","id":"deutsch-s-problem-单-qubit-版"},{"level":2,"text":"Deutsch's Algorithm","id":"deutsch-s-algorithm"},{"level":2,"text":"Phase Kickback 详细","id":"phase-kickback-详细"},{"level":2,"text":"Deutsch-Jozsa（N qubit 推广）","id":"deutsch-jozsa-n-qubit-推广"},{"level":2,"text":"Deutsch-Jozsa Circuit","id":"deutsch-jozsa-circuit"},{"level":2,"text":"干涉是关键","id":"干涉是关键"},{"level":2,"text":"实战 Qiskit","id":"实战-qiskit"},{"level":2,"text":"DJ Pattern 在量子算法中的复用","id":"dj-pattern-在量子算法中的复用"},{"level":2,"text":"量子算法 design 原则","id":"量子算法-design-原则"},{"level":2,"text":"局限","id":"局限"},{"level":2,"text":"历史地位","id":"历史地位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"量子隐形传态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/quantum-teleportation"},"next":{"title":"Shor 算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-algorithms/shor-algorithm"}}